{"id":"617ac90f851b7f95","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-splitting-lowness.md","title":"c.e. 保持策略中的低性测试","display":"lem-splitting-lowness — c.e. 保持策略中的低性测试","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-splitting-lowness","aliases":["20-lem-splitting-lowness"],"display":"lem-splitting-lowness — c.e. 保持策略中的低性测试","chapter":"7","section":"7.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Lemma 7.5.7","source_printed_pages":[160],"source_pdf_pages":[194],"depends_on":["[[20-lem-ce-preservation]]","[[20-df-low-high]]","[[20-thm-shoenfield-limit]]","[[20-thm-relative-smn]]","[[20-df-injury-elements]]","[[20-df-length-of-agreement]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-splitting-lowness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-splitting-lowness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-splitting-lowness — c.e. 保持策略中的低性测试"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Lemma 7.5.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>160</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>194</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"daa141317125dee0\" href=\"?note=daa141317125dee0\" title=\"20-lem-ce-preservation\">20-lem-ce-preservation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d81dfad676f32c4a\" href=\"?note=d81dfad676f32c4a\" title=\"20-thm-shoenfield-limit\">20-thm-shoenfield-limit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8b6134451906e575\" href=\"?note=8b6134451906e575\" title=\"20-thm-relative-smn\">20-thm-relative-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"18e11f4651f28406\" href=\"?note=18e11f4651f28406\" title=\"20-df-injury-elements\">20-df-injury-elements</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2e0d85a730fd3a26\" href=\"?note=2e0d85a730fd3a26\" title=\"20-df-length-of-agreement\">20-df-length-of-agreement</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s,C_s\">\\(A_s,C_s\\)</span> 为统一可计算递增有限集，极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,C\">\\(A,C\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 非可计算。针对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的上游保持限制满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall j\\ [|\\operatorname{InjElem}(A_\\bullet,r,j)|&lt;\\omega]\">\\(\\forall j\\ [|\\operatorname{InjElem}(A_\\bullet,r,j)|&lt;\\omega]\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"daa141317125dee0\" href=\"?note=daa141317125dee0\" title=\"20-lem-ce-preservation\">20-lem-ce-preservation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d81dfad676f32c4a\" href=\"?note=d81dfad676f32c4a\" title=\"20-thm-shoenfield-limit\">20-thm-shoenfield-limit</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8b6134451906e575\" href=\"?note=8b6134451906e575\" title=\"20-thm-relative-smn\">20-thm-relative-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"18e11f4651f28406\" href=\"?note=18e11f4651f28406\" title=\"20-df-injury-elements\">20-df-injury-elements</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"2e0d85a730fd3a26\" href=\"?note=2e0d85a730fd3a26\" title=\"20-df-length-of-agreement\">20-df-length-of-agreement</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}lowness}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Low}_1(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}lowness}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Low}_1(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将有限布尔常数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=\\chi_C(0)\">\\(b=\\chi_C(0)\\)</span> 编入普通指标变换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_b(e)\">\\(g_b(e)\\)</span>：该 oracle 程序只在输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 上等待 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^X(e)\">\\(\\Phi_e^X(e)\\)</span> 停止，随后输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>；其他输入永不停止。这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 是存在性证明中固定的单个常数，不要求有效地从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的 c.e. 指标求出其否定成员信息。</p>\n<p>由保持引理，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(g_b(e),s)\">\\(\\ell(g_b(e),s)\\)</span> 有有限极限。对足够晚的阶段，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_s(0)=b\">\\(C_s(0)=b\\)</span>，且这个特别程序的阶段一致长度只可能是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。真实 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in A&#39;\">\\(e\\in A&#39;\\)</span> 时，有限停止见证保证它最终为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>；若其极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>，取最后损伤之后的一个正一致阶段，其停止计算受 use 保护，故真实 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A(e)\">\\(\\Phi_e^A(e)\\)</span> 也停止。于是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_{A&#39;}(e)=\\lim_s\\mathbf1_{\\{\\ell(g_b(e),s)&gt;0\\}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_{A&#39;}(e)=\\lim_s\\mathbf1_{\\{\\ell(g_b(e),s)&gt;0\\}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>右侧统一可计算，极限引理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(A&#39;\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>，反向归约由跳跃单调性成立。低性来自这项测试，不仅来自有限损伤。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 7.5.7；印刷页 160；PDF 第 194 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-lem-ce-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"daa141317125dee0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-ce-preservation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-low-high","status":"resolved","id":"91065cedbdf2fc27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-low-high]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-shoenfield-limit","status":"resolved","id":"d81dfad676f32c4a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-shoenfield-limit]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-relative-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8b6134451906e575","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-relative-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-injury-elements","status":"resolved","id":"18e11f4651f28406","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-injury-elements]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-length-of-agreement","status":"resolved","id":"2e0d85a730fd3a26","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-length-of-agreement]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-ce-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"daa141317125dee0","anchor":"ref-7"